  // race and gates are not in any game file decoded so far (the universe is set up by the compiled
  // script, l/001.obj). They are read from elite-games.ru's map: the X-Tension 2.1 map (map_1.gif, map_2.gif),
  // by sampling each cell's colour and the midpoint of every shared edge, where a wall is black
  // background and a gate is not. Gates are symmetric; each lists the directions it opens to.
  //
